  "Diana sets aside time with Hummice flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Diana tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Diana sets aside time with The Ugly Beast flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Diana tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Diana sets aside time with Hushpuppy flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. An hour passes. Calm stomach. Another hour. Nothing. \"It's food,\" Diana tells the fire. \"You know it in your gut. Literally.\" The Codex notes it.",
  "Diana sets aside time with Choir Toad flesh. Look, smell, touch — then the smallest taste, and wait. Their tongue goes numb. Their stomach heaves. \"NOT food,\" they gasp. \"Poison.\" The Codex notes it in grim letters. You will not make this mistake twice — Diana"
 ],
